SUMMARY:Feeling Lucky: Mistletoe Season
DESCRIPTION:A neighborhood cafe on Columbia Avenue\, the kind of easygoing local spot where there’s no dress code and no scene\, just a comfortable room where people actually talk. December fills up with parties full of people you already know. This is the other kind of night: a room full of singles who showed up on purpose\, a game at your table so nobody starts cold\, and a Wednesday that actually goes somewhere. How the night works: You check in with a host and get a name tag. There’s nothing to download and no profile to fill out at the door. The evening runs in three movements. First\, you’re seated at a small table with a game to play. That’s the icebreaker\, so nobody has to invent an opening line cold\, and the men move one table along each round\, which means every round is a genuinely new set of people. Then the structure drops away and it’s open mingling: go where you want\, talk to whoever you want\, for as long as it’s working. By that point you’ve already met most of the room. Last\, one-on-ones with the people you haven’t already sat with. Near the end you privately note anyone you’d like to see again\, and nobody else sees it. If someone noted you back\, that’s a match\, and you both get it that night. $29.99 through Wednesday\, November 18\, then $34.99. 21+ with valid ID. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/feeling-lucky-mistletoe-season/
LOCATION:Lucky Dog Cafe\, 1942 Columbia Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/quiet-16x91-1.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="SparkDate":MAILTO:hello@sparkdate.date
END:VEVENT
