SUMMARY:Beginner Crochet Class
DESCRIPTION:New to crochet? Learn how to get started from how to hold the hook and yarn\, to casting on\, making a chain\, and doing basic stitches. In the process you’ll be making a square washcloth and will come out of it able to read a pattern and enjoy your new hobby!\n\nThere will be two 2-hour classes held Thursday evenings from 6-8pm\, December 3rd & 10th. Each class will build upon skills learned the prior class.\n\nAppropriate for ages 10+. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
