SUMMARY:1st Friday Open House with Live Music
DESCRIPTION:Join us the first Friday of every month to enjoy all of the lovely artwork at Urban Arts House. Each month will feature open studios of resident artists\, homemade soup\, and live music.  \n\n\n\nDecember 4th line up: Music by Richard Ferrarelli (bass clarinet) & Matthew Woodson (steel pan) 6-8pm. Rick and Matt are both teachers for Music For Everyone! Homemade Italian Wedding Soup. Artwork by: Eric Tonzola Matt Grannells Tatiana Tisdale Eve Anise Pottery Tony Wiker Laura Alvis John Yecker Zach Shaffer Victoria Mowrer Rachel Hoffman \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
