SUMMARY:Light Up the Holidays at West End Place!
DESCRIPTION:Join Us for Our Tree Lighting & Holiday Open House!West End Place Apartments | 250 College Avenue\, Lancaster\, PA 17603 \nA Little Holiday Magic Awaits!Bring your friends\, family\, and neighbors to enjoy: \nDelicious bites from Merrymaking CateringHoliday cookie decoratingFreshly popped popcorn & hot cocoa barFestive holiday selfie stationLocal Makers Pop-Up featuring Rustic Spirit\, Friendship Heart Gallery\, and more local businesses soon to be announced! \nCelebrate With Us!Whether you’re a West End Place resident\, a Lancaster neighbor\, or visiting for the first time\, everyone is welcome! Come celebrate the season\, connect with the community\, and get a glimpse inside Lancaster’s newest apartment community. \nWe can’t wait to celebrate with you!
