SUMMARY:Photos with Krampus at Lancaster Cemetery
DESCRIPTION:Visit the Lancaster Cemetery for its ” Photos with Krampus” fundraiser! Stop by Lancaster Cemetery for holiday photos with Krampus\, a horned creature who punishes those who misbehave at Christmastime! Why not have a unique photo for this year’s holiday card?  \n\n\n\nSuggested donation is $10 for a few poses with (or without!) your pal Krampus. Visitors should bring their own cameras. Volunteers will be on site to assist. This event is first-come\, first-serve. Photo set-up may be outdoors this year. Proceeds go toward maintenance of Lancaster city’s historic Victorian cemetery. Leashed and well-behaved pets are welcome. All proceeds benefit The Lancaster Cemetery 501c13 non-profit in preserving\, maintaining\, and promoting the historic grounds and caretaker house. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/photos-with-krampus-at-lancaster-cemetery-2/
LOCATION:Lancaster Cemetery\, 205 East Lemon Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/11/PXL_20221126_1945534051-scaled.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Lancaster Cemetery":MAILTO:info@lancastercemetery.org
END:VEVENT
