SUMMARY:Needle Felting Wreath Making Workshop (Adult Event)
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a festive holiday workshop where we’ll be needle felting stars and using them and other decorations to arrange our very own wreaths! This beginner-friendly class will introduce you to the basics of needle felting as we transform soft wool into snowflake-esque stars. We will then fill in grapevine wreaths with our handmade felt stars\, winter greenery\, pinecones and bows!\n\nThis will be an adults-only workshop\, for ages 21+. Participants may bring their own food and alcoholic or n/a beverages to enjoy during the workshop.\n\nWarning: This event involves the use of sharp needles. Alcohol impairs motor skills and coordination\, increasing the risk of serious personal injury. By purchasing a ticket and participating\, you assume all risks and agree to hold the hosts and venue harmless from any liability or injury.\n\nMinimum of 3 participants for class to run. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/needle-felting-wreath-making-workshop-adult-event/
LOCATION:The Felted Fox\, 2029 Miller Rd.\, East Petersburg\, PA\, 17520\, United States
CATEGORIES:Education & Classes
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/11/Screenshot_20261110_104005_Chrome2.avif
END:VEVENT
