SUMMARY:Seán Heely's Celtic Christmas
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season with U.S. National Scottish Fiddle Champion Seán Heely and a cast of nationally acclaimed performers in a festive journey through the Celtic world. Featuring stirring fiddle and bagpipes\, dazzling Scottish and Irish dance\, and a rich tapestry of Gaelic carols\, traditional tunes\, and familiar holiday favorites\, this joyful production brings Winter Solstice traditions to life with energy and warmth. \n\nAccessibility: ASL interpretation\, sensory-friendly accommodations\, and audio description will be available. There will be a pre-show touch tour for blind and low-vision patrons. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/sean-heelys-celtic-christmas/
LOCATION:Ware Center for the Arts\, 42 N. Prince St.\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
