SUMMARY:40th Annual Winter Faire
DESCRIPTION:At Susquehanna Waldorf School\, Winter Faire is one of our most cherished traditions—a magical transformation of our school into a place of wonder\, warmth\, and seasonal delight. Each year\, parents\, faculty\, and staff come together to create an experience rooted in simple joys\, meaningful traditions\, and the magic of community.\n\nWinter Faire is more than a celebration. It is an opportunity to gather\, to play\, to create\, to share a meal\, and to experience the season together. Through the Faire\, we also extend that spirit of care beyond our school\, supporting a meaningful cause in our wider community\, while raising essential funds that help sustain the education and experiences we treasure at SWS.\n\nWith great anticipation\, we look forward to welcoming you for this special tradition. Come slow down\, reconnect\, and experience the magic of Winter Faire with us. \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/40th-annual-winter-faire/
LOCATION:Susquehanna Waldorf School\, 15 W. Walnut St.\, Marietta\, PA\, 17547\, United States
CATEGORIES:Festivals & Annual Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/11/2026-WF-FB-event-3.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Susquehanna Waldorf School":MAILTO:najin.lee@susquehanna.org
END:VEVENT
