SUMMARY:Open Steep at Passenger Coffee & Tea
DESCRIPTION:Discover the world of tea. A tea community in Lancaster and online.\n\nOpen Steep is our free drop-in. This one is in person\, in Lancaster.\n\nGuests buy tea at Passenger\, and cups are supplied. Pull up a chair\, share what’s in your cup\, and meet other people on their own tea journey.\n\nAsk questions. Swap notes. Try something new.\n\nAttendance is free. RSVP so we know how many chairs to set out.\n\nWhy do you love tea? \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/open-steep-at-passenger-coffee-tea/
LOCATION:Passenger Flagship Cafe\, 7 W King St\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
