SUMMARY:The Hot Sardines - Holiday Stomp
DESCRIPTION:Jazz revivalists the Hot Sardines throw a raucous yuletide extravaganza inspired by classic holiday films (such as White Christmas and It’s a Wonderful Life) and timeless classics\, with hat tips to Louis Armstrong\, Edith Piaf\, Duke Ellington\, and beyond\, such as: “Mistletoe and Holly\,” “Le Noël de la Rue\,” “Dance of the Sugar Plum Fairy\,” “Blue Christmas\,” “Christmas Blues\,” “White Christmas\,” “Please Come Home for Christmas\,” and more. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
